sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant S as SMSC
    participant R as Rust smpp service
    participant Q as RabbitMQ
    participant N as to_nodejs consumer
    participant PG as Postgres
    participant W as WebSocket clients
    participant P as paging queue

    R->>Q: publish(smpp exchange, rk to_nodejs)
    Note over R,Q: SENDING before submit_sm
    Note over R,Q: SENT on success, FAILED with error_reason
    S->>R: deliver_sm (inbound SMS / receipt)
    R->>Q: publish Message status RECEIVED
    Q->>N: protobuf Message
    N->>N: fromBinary(MessageSchema)
    opt body starts with ack
        N->>P: forward JSON to AMQP_PAGING_QUEUE
    end
    alt message.id unknown to Postgres
        N->>PG: insert message + message_smpp
        N->>Q: enqueue if status SCHEDULED
    else known message
        N->>W: publish UPDATE_MESSAGE
    end
    N->>PG: insert message_status_history
    N->>Q: ack
